## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: Pet Stable Management: |cffffffffModels Browser|r
## Notes: Optional module for browsing pet models and pet roulette
## Author: Ginutty
## Version: 12.4.1
## IconTexture: 132253
## RequiredDeps: PetStableManagement
## LoadOnDemand: 1

# Data/ holds the tables generated by the psm-data pipeline and is the target of
# its sync_output_to_addon(). Never hand-edit those files -- change the generator.
# Kept in their own subfolder purely to keep generated and hand-written Lua apart;
# they are part of this addon, not a separate one.
#
# AbilitiesData.lua is NOT here -- it moved to the core addon's own Data/ folder
# (PetStableManagement/Data/AbilitiesData.lua), because Owned Pets' ability filter
# needs it at login and the core addon has no LoadOnDemand deferral to wait for.
# This module still reads the same global `AbilitiesData` table; it just no longer
# loads the file that defines it.
#
# Loaded first: nothing here reads them at file scope today, but ordering the data
# ahead of its consumers removes the question entirely.
Data/ModelsData.lua
Data/CoordsData.lua
Data/NotesData.lua
Data/ConditionsData.lua

# Asserts the tables above match what this addon expects (PSM_DataSchemaVersion).
# AbilitiesData.lua's own copy of this check now lives in core's Shared/DataSchema.lua
# instead -- it stamps the same global, checked independently on each side.
ModelsBrowser/Schema.lua

# Models Browser feature
ModelsBrowser/PetModels.lua
ModelsBrowser/ModelsDataLoader.lua
ModelsBrowser/NPCDataLoader.lua
ModelsBrowser/ModelsFilters.lua
ModelsBrowser/ModelsPanel.lua
ModelsBrowser/ModelRow.lua
ModelsBrowser/NPCRow.lua
ModelsBrowser/PetRoulette.lua
ModelsBrowser/AbilityBrowser.lua
ModelsBrowser/TamingChecker.lua
ModelsBrowser/SpecialTames.lua
